Warehouse Operational Efficiency Analysis
📌 Project Overview

Warehouse operations are a critical component of the FMCG supply chain. This project analyzes warehouse performance data to identify operational inefficiencies affecting productivity and resource utilization. Using Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), clustering techniques, and machine learning, the project uncovers key factors influencing warehouse throughput and provides actionable business recommendations.

🎯 Business Problem

Supply Flow FMCG Solutions experienced inconsistent warehouse performance due to:

Infrastructure limitations
Transport delays
Staffing shortages
Storage constraints
Equipment breakdowns
Uneven operational efficiency across regions

The objective was to analyze warehouse performance data and identify the major drivers of operational inefficiency.

