🔄 Project Workflow
1️⃣ Data Collection
Imported warehouse operational data from Excel files.
2️⃣ Data Cleaning
Removed inconsistencies
Handled missing values
Encoded categorical variables
Treated outliers using the IQR method
3️⃣ Exploratory Data Analysis

Performed:

Correlation Analysis
Zone-wise Performance Analysis
Warehouse Performance Comparison
KPI Evaluation
Visualization of operational patterns
4️⃣ Feature Engineering

Created a new feature:

Issue Ratio =
(Storage Issues + Warehouse Breakdowns)
/ Product Throughput

to better quantify operational inefficiencies.

5️⃣ Machine Learning

Applied:

Random Forest
Gradient Boosting

Ensemble model achieved 91.5% accuracy for performance analysis.

📈 Key Insights

✔ Storage issues showed the strongest positive correlation with warehouse throughput.

✔ Distance from the hub negatively impacted warehouse performance.

✔ East zone warehouses experienced the highest operational issue scores.

✔ Staffing shortages and equipment breakdowns contributed to reduced operational efficiency.

✔ Government certification status also influenced warehouse performance.

💡 Business Recommendations
Improve infrastructure in high-risk warehouse zones.
Increase staffing in underperforming warehouses.
Implement predictive maintenance.
Deploy real-time inventory monitoring systems.
Introduce IoT-based warehouse automation.
Adopt predictive analytics for proactive decision-making.
